                        "elements": [
                            {
                                "id": "0,2,0,0",
                                "type": 4,
                                "elements": "Here the unit \"cube_m\" is declared, equal to fifty cubic meters. When calculating, it is substituted into the result automatically, since in this example it is the simplest.",
